      "writtenOn": "2026-10-30T18:44:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Returning `std::expected\u003cuint8_t, RtsError\u003e` (or a small `DfuStatus` struct) from `dfu_poll_idle()` and `std::expected\u003cvoid, RtsError\u003e` from `dfu_clear_status()` lets callers and tests see the actual terminal DFU `bState` / `bStatus` (e.g., `errNOTDONE` vs. `errADDRESS` vs. USB transport failure) instead of collapsing all failures into `false`.",
